Package: modem-emu
Architecture: any
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11), systemd, init-system-helpers (>= 1.54)
Description: Analog modem emulator with SIP and an AT terminal
 Runs the extracted Eicon Analog DSP firmware with a native ADSP core,
 exposes an AT terminal, and transports modem audio over SIP/RTP.
 This local package includes firmware with unverified redistribution rights.
 It is intended for private deployment, not public redistribution.
